  "evidence": {
    "event_flag": "The per-figure update02114cd8 clears offset0x155 before dispatch. Movement02114560 sets it together with mFellOff the first time z<-0x30c000. Behavior immediately consumes it to call func0211ab38 with the figure position. Source/header search found no other access to this named field; the header has one source consumer.",
