    "comments": "The movement handler clamps vertical y to0 independently; its fall markers and final state test z depths, not vertical height. The selection one-shot returns3. The exit-column lookup widens a byte unsigned before a negative check, while the standing lookup preserves signedness and maps negative values to3; neither expression was repaired or normalized.",
