    "runtime_validation": "No new emulator claim: these names follow explicit accesses, dispatch tables, arithmetic and call sites. Visual animation identities and resource names remain unchanged.",
    "retained_constraints": [
      "Keep LAUNDER alias reads, scalar Fix12 call declarations, manual factory and lifecycle construction.",
      "Keep the VsBoneFile/VsBoneComponents partial layout views and the 12-word MatrixCopyWords aggregate-copy view; renaming S48 does not claim recovery of a stronger native type.",
      "Keep Behavior second walk induction variable, exit-table row*16/playerNo*4 address expression, mixed return types adapted into the animation PMF table, and all raw resource identifiers.",
